(loading_container_leg_linked ?loading_container ?transport_leg)
(not (destination_leg_loaded ?transport_leg))
(not (candidate_loading_verified ?candidate))

Thus we need candidate_staged_for_loading, skill certificate linked, operator linked, loading container linked, container linked to leg, destination leg not loaded, loading not verified.

Candidate_staged_for_loading can be achieved via stage_schedule_candidate or confirm_equipment_assignment (which sets candidate_staged_for_loading and equipment_confirmed). Let's see.

