(not (origin_leg_loaded ?transport_leg))
(not (candidate_staged_for_loading ?candidate))

Effect: candidate_staged_for_loading ?candidate.

Thus we need candidate_prepared, loading container linked, loading container loaded, container linked to leg, task profile linked, origin leg not loaded, not already staged.

Alternatively, confirm_equipment_assignment:

preconditions:

