(destination_availability_confirmed ?destination_availability)
(transport_leg_available ?transport_leg)

Effect: transport_leg_assembled, origin_linked, destination_linked, not transport_leg_available.

Thus we need origin and destination availability locked and confirmed, nodes ready, etc.

Thus we need to lock origin_availability and destination_availability.

