Thus we need candidate_prepared for origin_availability_alpha and destination_availability_alpha, and operator linked to each.

Thus we need to prepare those candidates (origin_availability_alpha and destination_availability_alpha) via confirm_candidate_preparedness (which requires candidate_created, vehicle_allocated, candidate_task_profile_linked). Wait: confirm_candidate_preparedness is for candidate_entity (maybe origin_availability_alpha). It requires (candidate_created ?candidate), (vehicle_allocated ?candidate), (candidate_task_profile_linked ?candidate ?route_task_profile). Effect: candidate_prepared ?candidate.

