5. Allocate vehicle_unit_beta to destination_availability_alpha (or gamma).

6. Attach route_task_profile_alpha to origin_availability_alpha, destination_availability_alpha, shift_candidate_alpha, shift_candidate_beta? Actually need for each candidate that requires task profile linking: for confirm_candidate_preparedness we need candidate_task_profile_linked. For lock_origin_availability we need candidate_prepared which needs task profile linked. For shift_candidate_alpha we need task profile linked for many actions (like assign_operator, etc). So we should attach task profile to all four candidates.

But note: attach_task_profile requires candidate_created, vehicle_allocated, route_task_profile_available. So we must allocate vehicle before attaching task profile.

